
<#
.SYNOPSIS
    This PowerShell script ensures that Windows 11
    password history is configured to remember the
    previous 24 passwords.

.NOTES
    Author          : Sinjin Torga-Eide
    LinkedIn        : https://www.linkedin.com/in/sinjin-torga-eide-674185297
    GitHub          : https://github.com/DatGuy84
    Date Created    : 2026-11-17
    Version         : 1.0
    CVEs            : N/A
    Plugin IDs      : N/A
    STIG-ID         : WN11-AC-000020
    Vulnerability ID: V-253300
    Severity        : Medium (CAT II)
    Documentation   : https://stigaview.com/products/win11/v2r7/WN11-AC-000020/

.TESTED ON
    Date(s) Tested  : 2026-11-17
    Tested By       : Sinjin Torga-Eide
    Systems Tested  : Windows 11 VM
    PowerShell Ver. : 5.1

.USAGE
    Run PowerShell as Administrator.

    Example:
    PS C:\> .\WN11-AC-000020.ps1

    This script configures Windows to remember
    the previous 24 passwords.
#>

# STIG WN11-AC-000020 Remediation

# Configure password history to remember 24 passwords
net accounts /uniquepw:24

# Verify password history policy
net accounts
